{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2021-11-10 19:03:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN OPENS NEW HEADQUARTERS BUILDING IN ATLANTA', 'text': 'ATLANTA, NOV. 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) TODAY FORMALLY OPENED ITS STATE-OF-THE-ART HEADQUARTERS IN MIDTOWN ATLANTA\xa0FOLLOWING A RIBBON-CUTTING CEREMONY THAT FEATURED GOVERNOR BRIAN P. KEMP, SENATOR RAPHAEL WARNOCK, MAYOR KEISHA LANCE BOTTOMS, NORFOLK SOUTHERN EMPLOYEES, AND CIVIC AND BUSINESS LEADERS FROM ACROSS ATLANTA.'}